{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.BraidKnot.TwoRowStratum","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.TwoRowStratum","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Nat.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.List.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.List.Range","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.NormNum"],"declarations":30,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.TwoRowStratum.dominant_he4_in_stratum","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.TwoRowStratum.dominant_he4_in_stratum","kind":"theorem","line":166,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/TwoRowStratum.lean#L166-L168","doc":"The dominant block (9, 3) explicitly belongs to Λ²(12). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.TwoRowStratum.twoRow_of_length_le_two","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.TwoRowStratum.twoRow_of_length_le_two","kind":"theorem","line":158,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/TwoRowStratum.lean#L158-L164","doc":"Bridge lemma: any list of length ≤ 2 is a two-row partition of\nits sum.  Used by HasHe4DominantBlock to connect the dominant\nblock (9, 3) to TwoRowStratum 12. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.TwoRowStratum.HasTwoRowProjection.instInhabited","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.TwoRowStratum.HasTwoRowProjection.instInhabited","kind":"instance","line":153,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/TwoRowStratum.lean#L153-L154","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.TwoRowStratum.HasTwoRowProjection.trivialInstance","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.TwoRowStratum.HasTwoRowProjection.trivialInstance","kind":"def","line":146,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/TwoRowStratum.lean#L146-L151","doc":"The trivial instance: π = id, satisfying idempotency vacuously.\nUsed as the n=0 baseline (the trivial Hecke algebra has only one\nWedderburn block, which is the [0] = (0) partition itself in Λ²). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.TwoRowStratum.HasTwoRowProjection.piComplement","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.TwoRowStratum.HasTwoRowProjection.piComplement","kind":"def","line":140,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/TwoRowStratum.lean#L140-L144","doc":"The complement projection 1 − π_{2-row} (defined point-wise as the\n\"non-two-row\" part: anything that's not in the image of π).  In\na true direct-sum setting this would be a co-projection. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.TwoRowStratum.HasTwoRowProjection.idempotent","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.TwoRowStratum.HasTwoRowProjection.idempotent","kind":"theorem","line":134,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/TwoRowStratum.lean#L134-L134","doc":"Idempotency: π² = π. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.TwoRowStratum.HasTwoRowProjection.pi","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.TwoRowStratum.HasTwoRowProjection.pi","kind":"def","line":132,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/TwoRowStratum.lean#L132-L132","doc":"The projection π_{2-row} : HeckeAlg → HeckeAlg as a function. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.TwoRowStratum.HasTwoRowProjection.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.TwoRowStratum.HasTwoRowProjection.mk","kind":"ctor","line":130,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/TwoRowStratum.lean#L130-L130","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.TwoRowStratum.HasTwoRowProjection","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.TwoRowStratum.HasTwoRowProjection","kind":"class","line":122,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/TwoRowStratum.lean#L122-L134","doc":"The two-row projection on the Wedderburn decomposition.\n\nAxiomatised here as a class encoding the splitting\n`tr_M(β) = tr_M(π_{2-row} β) + tr_M((1 - π_{2-row}) β)` for any\nHecke element β.  The concrete projection requires the full\nWedderburn decomposition apparatus (per-partition irrep blocks\nHoefsmit basis); the class allows downstream consumers to take\nits existence as a typeclass hypothesis. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:def:two-row-projection","label":"def:two-row-projection","md":"quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/two-row-projection.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.TwoRowStratum.hasTwoRowCardinality_of","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.TwoRowStratum.hasTwoRowCardinality_of","kind":"def","line":117,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/TwoRowStratum.lean#L117-L120","doc":"Universal cardinality instance: for any n, take the constructive\nenumeration's length. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.TwoRowStratum.instHasTwoRowCardinalityOfNatNat_3","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.TwoRowStratum.instHasTwoRowCardinalityOfNatNat_3","kind":"instance","line":113,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/TwoRowStratum.lean#L113-L115","doc":"Concrete instance for n = 9 (T or ³He). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.TwoRowStratum.instHasTwoRowCardinalityOfNatNat_2","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.TwoRowStratum.instHasTwoRowCardinalityOfNatNat_2","kind":"instance","line":109,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/TwoRowStratum.lean#L109-L111","doc":"Concrete instance for n = 6 (deuteron).  ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.TwoRowStratum.instHasTwoRowCardinalityOfNatNat_1","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.TwoRowStratum.instHasTwoRowCardinalityOfNatNat_1","kind":"instance","line":104,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/TwoRowStratum.lean#L104-L107","doc":"Concrete instance for n = 12 (⁴He) — derived from the constructive\n`enumerateTwoRow_length` rather than axiomatised. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.TwoRowStratum.instHasTwoRowCardinalityOfNatNat","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.TwoRowStratum.instHasTwoRowCardinalityOfNatNat","kind":"instance","line":101,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/TwoRowStratum.lean#L101-L102","doc":"Trivial instance for n = 0: only the empty partition. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.TwoRowStratum.HasTwoRowCardinality.card_eq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.TwoRowStratum.HasTwoRowCardinality.card_eq","kind":"theorem","line":99,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/TwoRowStratum.lean#L99-L99","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.TwoRowStratum.HasTwoRowCardinality.card_two_row","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.TwoRowStratum.HasTwoRowCardinality.card_two_row","kind":"def","line":98,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/TwoRowStratum.lean#L98-L98","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.TwoRowStratum.HasTwoRowCardinality.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.TwoRowStratum.HasTwoRowCardinality.mk","kind":"ctor","line":97,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/TwoRowStratum.lean#L97-L97","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.TwoRowStratum.HasTwoRowCardinality","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.TwoRowStratum.HasTwoRowCardinality","kind":"class","line":94,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/TwoRowStratum.lean#L94-L99","doc":"Cardinality of Λ²(n): exactly ⌊n/2⌋ + 1 partitions (the pairs\n(n-k, k) for 0 ≤ k ≤ ⌊n/2⌋).  Now PROVED by direct construction\nvia `enumerateTwoRow` rather than axiomatised. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.TwoRowStratum.card_two_row_even_small","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.TwoRowStratum.card_two_row_even_small","kind":"theorem","line":89,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/TwoRowStratum.lean#L89-L92","doc":"Concrete cardinality |Λ²(n)| at small even n. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.TwoRowStratum.card_two_row_12","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.TwoRowStratum.card_two_row_12","kind":"theorem","line":86,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/TwoRowStratum.lean#L86-L87","doc":"Concrete cardinality |Λ²(12)| = 7. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.TwoRowStratum.enumerateTwoRow_length","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.TwoRowStratum.enumerateTwoRow_length","kind":"theorem","line":75,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/TwoRowStratum.lean#L75-L78","doc":"The enumeration has cardinality ⌊n/2⌋ + 1. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.TwoRowStratum.enumerateTwoRow","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.TwoRowStratum.enumerateTwoRow","kind":"def","line":66,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/TwoRowStratum.lean#L66-L73","doc":"The canonical enumeration of Λ²(n) as a list: for each\n`k ∈ {0, 1, …, ⌊n/2⌋}`, emit the pair `(n - k, k)` — but with\nthe trivial-rep `(n)` written as `[n]` and the equal-pair case\n`(n/2, n/2)` as `[n/2, n/2]`.  Excludes any zero-component\npartitions (so `(n, 0) ↦ [n]` rather than `[n, 0]`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.TwoRowStratum.instDecidableTwoRowStratum","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.TwoRowStratum.instDecidableTwoRowStratum","kind":"instance","line":63,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/TwoRowStratum.lean#L63-L64","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.TwoRowStratum.TwoRowStratum","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.TwoRowStratum.TwoRowStratum","kind":"def","line":57,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/TwoRowStratum.lean#L57-L61","doc":"The two-row stratum Λ²(n) as the set of partition lists that\n(i) sum to n and (ii) satisfy IsTwoRow.  Stated as a Prop so\nthat membership is decidable for any concrete partition. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.TwoRowStratum.not_isTwoRow_triple","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.TwoRowStratum.not_isTwoRow_triple","kind":"theorem","line":52,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/TwoRowStratum.lean#L52-L55","doc":"A three-or-more element list is NOT two-row. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.TwoRowStratum.isTwoRow_pair","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.TwoRowStratum.isTwoRow_pair","kind":"theorem","line":49,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/TwoRowStratum.lean#L49-L50","doc":"A two-element partition is two-row. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.TwoRowStratum.isTwoRow_singleton","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.TwoRowStratum.isTwoRow_singleton","kind":"theorem","line":46,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/TwoRowStratum.lean#L46-L47","doc":"A singleton partition is two-row. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.TwoRowStratum.isTwoRow_nil","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.TwoRowStratum.isTwoRow_nil","kind":"theorem","line":43,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/TwoRowStratum.lean#L43-L44","doc":"The empty partition is two-row. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.TwoRowStratum.instDecidableIsTwoRow","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.TwoRowStratum.instDecidableIsTwoRow","kind":"instance","line":40,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/TwoRowStratum.lean#L40-L41","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.TwoRowStratum.IsTwoRow","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.TwoRowStratum.IsTwoRow","kind":"def","line":35,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/TwoRowStratum.lean#L35-L38","doc":"A partition is \"two-row\" iff its length (number of nonzero parts)\nis at most 2.  We model partitions abstractly as a sorted list of\npositive integers; `IsTwoRow` is a decidable predicate. ","signatureChunk":0}]}